  "_doc": "Stream E (M2). The keep's drill sergeant, who never stopped drilling the recruits. A shouter. P1: he barks ORDERS that tell you what is coming (\"Shields!\" = a frontal cone, \"Spears!\" = lines across the yard) and throws training dummies that become cover. His WAR DRUM (a brazier you \"use\" to smash) speeds his recruits; smash it. At 50% he calls the recruits; kill them and he drops his guard. Enrage 5 min.",
  "party": "Solo: readable and forgiving. 2-3: the recruits are the test. 5: easy; M5: +1 recruit per player, health x1.5.",
